description: Zentro Web conventions and rules
alwaysApply: true
---

The instructions for this repository live in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Read it — it is
the single source of truth for every AI tool used here, so there is nothing to keep in sync.

The rules most likely to cause real bugs, restated so they are never missed:

1. The app is **zoneless**. Anything a template reads must be a `signal`. A plain class
   property will not re-render and **nothing warns you**.
2. Components are `OnPush`, standalone, and use `inject()` over constructor injection.
3. Colors and spacing come from Tailwind theme tokens. **Never raw hex**, never arbitrary
   `[...]` values — a raw color is invisible to the theme and breaks in dark mode.
4. Actions are `<button>`, navigation is `<a>`. Everything interactive is keyboard-reachable
   and has an accessible name.
5. Layer imports go one way: `features → shared → core`. Never feature-to-feature.
6. **Never do arithmetic on money.** The API computes; this app formats.
7. API types come from `core/api/generated/` via `npm run api:sync`. Never hand-write an
   interface mirroring a response.
8. The access token lives in memory only — never `localStorage` or `sessionStorage`.

Before writing any color or spacing value, read `docs/styling.md`.
